{"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_020E90","resource_class":"BRIEFING_NBE","status":"TRANSLATED_PENDING_CSV_MERGE","translations":[{"unique_index":0,"cn_text":"敌方的坦克、装甲车和攻击直升机，始终都有一个战斗班随行。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":84,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":1,"cn_text":"这些士兵单兵战斗力并不算特别高，但配合非常娴熟，很难对付。光是那些机器的火力就已经够要命了。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":138,"review_flag":"AUX_MACHINE_FIREPOWER_CLAUSE_RESTORED"},{"unique_index":2,"cn_text":"这样才有打倒的价值。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":30,"review_flag":"AUX_ROW_MISALIGNMENT_IGNORED"},{"unique_index":3,"cn_text":"真打起来你就没法这么说了。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":39,"review_flag":"AUX_ROW_MISALIGNMENT_IGNORED"},{"unique_index":4,"cn_text":"记住，千万别让他们包围你。要是被赶进敌方机器的杀伤区，那可就惨了。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":99,"review_flag":"AUX_KILL_ZONE_CLAUSE_RESTORED"},{"unique_index":5,"cn_text":"还要留意敌人之间的交流。从对话判断他们的行动并抢先出手，就能创造胜机。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":105,"review_flag":"AUX_SECOND_CLAUSE_RESTORED"},{"unique_index":6,"cn_text":"不是只有正面硬碰硬这一种打法。别忘了游击战的方式。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":75,"review_flag":"AUX_ROW_MISALIGNMENT_IGNORED"},{"unique_index":7,"cn_text":"明白。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":9,"review_flag":""}]}